      "construct": ".list(",
      "reason": "Type::list(max): write checks the length fits an int and read checks the declared size against the bound; both are reproduced by the hooks. The hand read also reserved min(size, 65536, readable bytes) up front; the generated loop grows the Vec as it reads, so a forged size reserves nothing."
